                                "sense_id": "a399b4b4-486e-3d05-ab73-93c7a7a2a8e6",
                                "text": "Argent, a lion rampant azure, debruised by a bend gobony ermine and gules."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f0a967b7-ce9b-4159-a8b3-b7cd20e2eb21",
                                "sense_id": "a399b4b4-486e-3d05-ab73-93c7a7a2a8e6",
                                "text": "There is no difficulty whatever in drawing a gobony or a checky bordure."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1faa0399-d8df-4ea7-b969-93353dc6c1b8",
                                "sense_id": "a399b4b4-486e-3d05-ab73-93c7a7a2a8e6",
                                "text": "The coat of Steenhuse appears a second time, no. 638, but here it is in the usual form, Bendy of six or and azure with the ombre of a lion over all and a border gobony argent and gules. An odd feature is that the segments of the gobony borders are cut diagonally[…]."
